  repository: yawn-ai/yawn.bot
  surfaces:
    - src/domain/yawn-entrance-questions.ts — default judgments on all twelve prompts
    - src/domain/yawn-mental-model-network.ts — the ranking receipt
    - src/domain/yawn-concept-definition.ts — the receipt on the concept adapter
    - src/components/yawn-question-view/yawn-question-view.tsx — the paged flow
    - src/components/yawn-question-view/yawn-question-view.module.css — pagination in the existing skin
    - src/components/yawn-question-view/yawn-question-disclosure.tsx — an initial open state
    - src/components/yawn-question-view/public-concept-default.tsx — forwards receipt and flow
    - src/components/bot/new-yawn-imprint.tsx — judgments and the flow on /new
    - src/app/page.tsx, src/app/new/page.tsx — the page id travels in the address
  verification:
    - npm run lint — 0 errors, 8 warnings, all pre-existing and none in changed files
    - npm run typecheck — clean; one pre-existing error from a missing generated asset manifest
    - npx vitest run — 2911 passed, 2 failed, 5 files failed to load; all 7 failures reproduce on the unchanged tree
    - rendered at 1280 and 390 wide; no page errors, no horizontal overflow
    - the false disclaimer no longer appears anywhere on the index

boundary:
